title: 'fix(sc-network-gossip): deduplicate local message registration'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary
    - Fixes `ConsensusGossip::register_message_hashed` to properly deduplicate by message hash before inserting into the `LruMap`
    - Adds a regression test that ensures calling `register_message` with identical message bytes does not store duplicates
crates:
- name: sc-network-gossip
  bump: patch
